# Source event_handlers.c: key 1 starts, W/D move, LB shoots, Escape returns/menu exits.
at 100 key 1 down
at 101 key 1 up
at 150 key D down
at 180 key D up
at 200 mouse 0 0 1
at 201 mouse 0 0 0
at 220 key W down
at 250 key W up
at 550 key ESC down
at 551 key ESC up
at 600 key ESC down
at 601 key ESC up
